    "body": "### Problem\n\nThe help section on Diff Orig doesn't clearly state that the command must be defined. This has caused confusion for at least one other user: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39352\nThe Vim docs for this section reference defaults.vim which provides an example which makes it a bit clearer. Some discussion here: https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/20048\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nNot really anything to reproduce. \n\n### Expected behavior\n\nDocs should be more helpful\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\n v0.13.0-dev-1095+g53cbf66bd2 (and previous)\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nNo\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nCachyOS, not relevant\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nGhostty, Not relevant\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nNot relevant\n\n### Installation\n\nAUR ",
